  "notes": "This report covers two related reactor trip events (03/12/2024 and 03/17/2024) at Unit 2, both traced to the same root design error (missing current amplifier in Turbine Digital Control System modification). Modeled as parallel failure chains sharing the same root cause and converging failure mode (alternate MFP unable to compensate), each terminating in its own Consequence node. Previous similar event stub LER key preserved exactly as stated ('1-2023-001') per instructions, referring to Unit 1. Component/system for MFP itself not separately modeled as System node since MFP is Component, not EIIS system; JK system used for turbine control per Block 13."
